Animated Fish by Quaternius on OpenGameArt.org
Lowpoly Animated Farm Animal Pack by Quaternius on OpenGameArt.org
Lowpoly Crops Pack by Quaternius on OpenGameArt.org
Rat Pack by OverActionGameStudio on OpenGameArt.org
Deer Low Poly by CrownJoshua on OpenGameArt.org

Shaders
